     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Wednesday, 17 May 2017 20:34:11 UTC+2, Joe Cheng [RStudio]  wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">When passing a reactive expression to a module, you have to ask yourself: Do I want to pass the <i>current</i> value of the reactive expression (i.e. a snapshot in time) to the module, or do I want the module to have access to the <i>current and future</i> values of the reactive? It&#39;s almost always the latter. And in that case, in the callModule call you&#39;ll omit the parenthesis, and add them inside the module.<div><br></div><div>So this line:</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\">callModule(</span><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">downData</span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&#39;</span>downCSVdata<span>&#39;</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&#39;</span>mydata.csv<span>&#39;</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\">, dataGen())</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><br></span></div><div>becomes this:</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\">callModule(</span><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">downData</span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&#39;</span>downCSVdata<span>&#39;</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&#39;</span>mydata.csv<span>&#39;</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\">, dataGen)</span><br></div><div><br></div><div>And this line:</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\">write.csv(</span><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"> </span><span 